steps.description:
Add an `aiSummary` field to `InvestigationTrace`:
```typescript
interface AIRunSummary {
  model: string;
  backend: 'cloud' | 'local' | 'off';
  totalCalls: number;
  successfulCalls: number;
  failedCalls: number;
  totalLatencyMs: number;
  avgLatencyMs: number;
  totalPromptTokens?: number;
  totalCompletionTokens?: number;
  estimatedCostUsd?: number;
}
```
Instrument `LLMClient.investigateSeed()` to track per-call latency (Date.now delta) and token usage (from OpenAI response.usage). Return these alongside the AIFindingResponse. In the AI investigator, accumulate per-seed stats and return them as part of the investigation result metadata. In `analyzeBundlePipeline`, populate `trace.aiSummary` from the accumulated stats. Add the summary to the JSON report output under a top-level `aiSummary` key. Add unit tests for the LLMClient latency tracking (mock the OpenAI client) and for the summary aggregation logic.
